{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "16b73060f25754dba1b97625f69c78b78c9c85e6e825895f0b1c7310d4ccd579", "ja": "変わりゆく日常", "zh": "改变的日常", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5a9e9bbd99875b754929219cc9ee13dd5007cbe1d7bb33725c98317ac97d4ee2", "ja": "ストリートシンガーのジュリアは路上ライブ\nの最中、謎の武装集団に追われてきた春香と\nやよいを助ける。追い込まれピンチになった\nとき、同じストリートの顔なじみ歩が現れ、\n逃がしてもらうのだった。", "zh": "街头歌手茱莉亚在街头演出时，救下了被神秘武装集团追赶的春香和弥生。被逼入绝境、陷入危机时，同样是这条街熟人的阿步出现，让她们得以逃脱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1000_se", "source_sha256": "8e304ee6b38f84cceecfd8d0c9dd417691f00be115c3e722325df5bc138efcc4", "ja": "ジャーン♪　ジャカジャカ……♪", "zh": "锵——♪ 锵锵锵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "47e9aa07bf098a3e9bb7475739b7bea980928fe4e85d5a8f31345821d32fed2f", "ja": "（こうやって、路上で歌っていると、\nそれなりにわかってくることがある……）", "zh": "（像这样在街头唱歌，就会渐渐明白一些事情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "f34780047c0b4786221db25c469936bd3b7f436a7e5828d579446d28cb742ef6", "ja": "（最近、町が妙に騒がしい。取り繕っちゃいるが、\nストリートの空気は、肌で感じるからな）", "zh": "（最近城里莫名地有些喧闹。虽然大家都在装作若无其事，但街头的气氛，我可是能亲身感受到的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "c1dac5a9ab0da183f39681c258174e4790044ea8b385d6372da9178edca80861", "ja": "（誰もが息をひそめて、何かに怯えているような……。\nあの日から、全てが変わっちまった）", "zh": "（所有人都屏住呼吸，像是在害怕着什么……。从那天起，一切都变了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "d27f878fa277fe378e6ae30525d994e584d9fdef50f8da0d5c9700dd01edd6e0", "ja": "（どっかの新聞部員が、ウチらの頭の中に、\n『忘れないで』って書き込みやがった、あの日から）", "zh": "（从那天起，某个新闻部的家伙就往咱们脑子里写下了‘不要忘记’这句话。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1005_se", "source_sha256": "9221696a168196148e6477f34defc71c9aa43bf023477f44ffad0593e4360534", "ja": "ジャカジャッ……ジャーンッ♪", "zh": "锵锵……锵——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1006_audience", "source_sha256": "44848cd83920db7f2ff765b7bcd97e0ef8f87cffda55bae54f78b0a3d4f5e1d4", "ja": "ワー、パチパチパチ……", "zh": "哇——啪啪啪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "28abceb8e707598dc8a62762fa8f1769c9334f3951c9b3dda3e0ea71fdb0b224", "ja": "……サンキュ♪　じゃあ次は……派手な曲にするか！\nみんなもノッてくれよな？　いくぜ……！", "zh": "……谢啦♪　那接下来……就来首炸场的曲子吧！\n大家也都要跟上节奏嗨起来哦？　要上咯……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1008_se", "source_sha256": "2918c262c5ca7362a3dc858b6c421012caa1bc4c3dc291dec51971e7a891c74c", "ja": "……ドッカーン！！！！", "zh": "……轰隆隆！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1009_tukou2", "source_sha256": "4d39f4648a89257a60910fb222696a43ecdc0073e701a3ad42bd11f34aa66d67", "ja": "キャーッ！？　ワアアアァァーッ！", "zh": "呀——！？哇啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "c70bd454a21424b21d4aff31c521a2d845980aa3e1639f193d8b8ac2dbe6ea3a", "ja": "うおっ！？　なんだ！？　爆発……？", "zh": "呜哇！？怎么了！？爆炸……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1011_se", "source_sha256": "b57f2cb36e3937dd33c188d3353be42ab20c63128bb713d6385ce0585eda40c1", "ja": "ザッ、ザッ、ザッ、ザッ！", "zh": "嚓、嚓、嚓、嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1012_guntai1", "source_sha256": "ab187078346c8e05347563cdaded5fc110acb501a2ee6a61a37b87bd8ca932b7", "ja": "一網打尽だ！　一人も逃がすな！", "zh": "一网打尽！一个也别让他们逃掉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "e3f1e7afcd6517b31ae32e913f5d25125e8284b2d5a8ba745f6c14d295e45a7b", "ja": "あれは、機動風紀委員か？　にしちゃ、\n装備がだいぶいかついな……何が起きてんだ？", "zh": "那是机动风纪委员吗？可要是这样，\n装备也未免太吓人了吧……到底发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "82c226b3d35d7e2e4cbf78b408770d26d014987256b7c17526e12fc71679f807", "ja": "……っ！？　あれは……！", "zh": "……っ！？　那是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "0e210b2cb209082b078abbc4b721a11bea7df12e5085de7eed5c0f41e2167288", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\nはわわっ！？　追いかけてきてますよ、春香さん！", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……  \n哇哇！？春香小姐，它追上来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "e81170dbf138fae33c3c10a73f96a2968519539314218811198bf93e9f047cc9", "ja": "ほ、本当だ！　なんで？\nただ買い物してただけなのに……ハァ、ハァ……！", "zh": "真、真的！为什么？\n明明只是在买东西而已……哈、哈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1017_guntai1", "source_sha256": "8ae935c1d8b4d5310b359af4c995254703c620fb11ac67868a24f21be886137c", "ja": "左右から追い詰めるぞ！　GO、GO、GO！", "zh": "从左右两边包抄夹击！GO、GO、GO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "38b3ae68a886207956f827491ced61310877335c1f4faffb0a0c1208b454baba", "ja": "……くっ！　仕方ないか……。", "zh": "……唔！没办法了吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1019_se", "source_sha256": "43178c5a346c9b245510e4b08fff106df585328d95a1b7af0f9cd6aefd70b4f8", "ja": "シュンッ！", "zh": "唰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "e9a7f55e8e8bfe6539b6aaf892dea8dcbb9fc5a9d2ba86b86fa38319ead131db", "ja": "おい！　いい加減にしろ！\n女の子2人に、よってたかって、みっともねえな。", "zh": "喂！你们闹够了吧！这么多人围攻2个女孩子，真难看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "bc2e39a4618d92b1205e6e1c3435b98de2788962aaa75116aa83e3adf5bd8297", "ja": "……えっ！？　だ、誰？　いつの間に……？", "zh": "……诶！？是、是谁？什么时候来的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1022_guntai1", "source_sha256": "6fdd9920abdf58b814a6493abf58f45ac9a882ea3c69942b1db9493855db09a1", "ja": "なんだ、貴様は！", "zh": "你是什么人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "c9a8e840ecc865f0a7a6a6b7d855723b9b3215d3b6f1f1f443c9a40a6472e020", "ja": "通りすがりのロックシンガーだよ。\n歌が聴きたいなら、もっと静かにしてくれ。", "zh": "只是个路过的摇滚歌手。想听歌的话，就安静点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "27e95e3bb6b97905aac96018763df262f185bdbc85a2e61c90b399faf4a00bd4", "ja": "か、かっこいい……。", "zh": "好、好帅……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1025_guntai1", "source_sha256": "ad246360ca64eb53aae4e010a001ce325b237ed487965e9dc3a0036c9e9312f2", "ja": "ええい、構わん！　撃て、撃てーっ！", "zh": "罢了，不管了！开火，开火——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1026_se", "source_sha256": "7266d90360ebc3897623dbd897fe9895f81deedfc350ac9605de30e3fcc34081", "ja": "ドン！　ドンドンッ！", "zh": "咚！咚咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "1e69ea6313d20387e20110775278a1c17ad36dae1156da44918a137d6fe979ce", "ja": "うわっ！？　マジで撃ってきやがった！\nおい、戦具は持ってないのか？", "zh": "哇！？居然真的朝这边开枪了！\n喂，你没带战具吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1028_001har", "source_sha256": "0eddbb6d66cef13810e3cad7f0f192f7df9d006a8cacc0712a66cf79ae4f8190", "ja": "えっ、わ、私？\nええと……戦具って、なんのこと？", "zh": "诶，我、我吗？\n那个……你说的战具，是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "2102459b431249d38f5a938e5592cfacadc3ae10ebd1418f471e0c72fb1f66b6", "ja": "ああ、まだ目覚めてないのか……悪い、忘れてくれ。\n参ったな、あたしのは防戦には向いてないし……。", "zh": "啊，还没觉醒吗……抱歉，忘了吧。\n真伤脑筋，我的战具不适合防守……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1030_005yay", "source_sha256": "ff834ce7f3be2104b2370811d70b1b2b7acfcac6f6f5a3c056c2a13b7cdb3e67", "ja": "あ、私、戦具あります！　でも……\n陽界では使っちゃダメなルールなんですよね？", "zh": "啊，我有战斗装备！不过……\n在阳界不能使用，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "a9ae9f8bb907c0e900986e93a525474d17f265ee763e4b0591762964558ea93a", "ja": "えっ！？　……い、いや、なんでもいい！\nルールとか言ってる場合じゃない……やってくれ！", "zh": "诶！？……不、没什么都行！\n现在可不是管规则的时候……快用吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1032_005yay", "source_sha256": "1c6e2a1f5f71befdfb08cd6d2e394b2eddb27156e457c2ea79ce9de6004b2e4e", "ja": "は、はい！　カモン、『ヴェロチョロ』ーッ！", "zh": "好、好的！来吧，《贝洛啾》——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1033_verotyoro", "source_sha256": "36d972f5e0e4c148e04877a00c49f59cbfe4f72bda5302d87d7fdc3d07b9ef73", "ja": "ヴェロッ！", "zh": "哇哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1034_se", "source_sha256": "899f78a5ad2a15c04f7348845a4b7e1dc37305da9921edab1b6f8117e58ef159", "ja": "ズシーンッ！！！！", "zh": "咚——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1035_001har", "source_sha256": "51bb43ff827b3e2b10ebc594771744957826d698930907f5dd4ad7a821e514de", "ja": "わわっ！？　な、なに、あれ！？\nすっごく大きなカエル……の、ぬいぐるみ？", "zh": "哇哇！？那、那是什么！？\n好大一只青蛙……玩偶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1036_005yay", "source_sha256": "63688818d87214944e1409f71b93815f3ea319d95de05de51e7bbbb738f0d7ec", "ja": "あれが私の戦具ですー！\nヴェロチョロ、あの人たちを追い払って！", "zh": "那就是我的战具～！\n维罗乔罗，把那些人赶跑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1037_verotyoro", "source_sha256": "a0126e5fd47b7324dfbbc27e2ba2e430d11286d30052d5da75c553eb07854f8c", "ja": "ヴェロロロロロロローッ！", "zh": "威——罗罗罗罗罗——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1038_guntai1", "source_sha256": "52e9ed32283a44347e85b6d6a0cff82a75594f802ae55187628ae2dbc0ebc634", "ja": "くっ、戦具だ！　戦具使いがいたぞ！\n我々だけでは勝てん、司令に連絡しろ！　ぐふっ！？", "zh": "可恶，是战具！有个战具使者！\n光靠我们赢不了，快联系司令！呃啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1039_se", "source_sha256": "717a7094a653f7e5bf549b16f28a84f476853ca46a85e66a8cac523c825643bc", "ja": "ドン、ドン！　チュインッ！　ダダダダ……！", "zh": "咚、咚！锵！哒哒哒哒……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "cdb03cdf77e5ee43a80f95038ffd3a21ad7d0c0e91af9212e08266efc19d20f3", "ja": "おいおい、とんでもねえ戦具だな！？\nあの人数とやり合ってるぞ……。", "zh": "喂喂，这武器也太夸张了吧！？\n居然在和那么多人交战……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1041_guntai1", "source_sha256": "bcd3077bbf92c8842a374d7b677231469fa6a1d17836e84ba587ec1f20567a49", "ja": "戦具使い本体を狙うぞ！　回り込め！", "zh": "瞄准战具使的本体！绕到后面去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1042_005yay", "source_sha256": "dcf47e8cdb01d074f52b66d1a791369109754a7acdbd8efce1c66c6c607f7218", "ja": "は、はわわっ！？　でも、相手が多すぎます！\n全員止めることはできないかも……！？", "zh": "哈、哈哇！？可是，对手太多了！\n可能没办法阻止所有人……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1043_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ca380cb359b900ba06e6d906d879e43b4463e3a0b5e350ccc5e6e142f3383c17", "ja": "おーい！　こっち！　こっちに来て！", "zh": "喂——！这边！到这边来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1044_001har", "source_sha256": "8774f36825b50d5aff9397e52f383dcef55cbb150f52ef17eb78f95b8194628d", "ja": "わっ！？　え、えっと……どなた？", "zh": "哇！？呃、那个……请问您是哪位？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1045_050jul", "source_sha256": "53ceaa014c0de19209742f03e498a262d9a0df43392c192012a5fe49c559800b", "ja": "おっ、歩じゃねーか！　こいつはダンサーの\n舞浜歩っていって、ストリートの馴染みなんだ。", "zh": "哦，这不是步吗！这位是舞者舞滨步，是我在街头混熟的朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_01_1046_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6a6585f584e646ac5889d89dac75c57d78f3f912e3e600311d5bdf6405fb4eee", "ja": "ジュリア、話は後にしようってば！\nとりあえずついてきて！　裏から逃げるよ！", "zh": "茱莉亚，之后再说啦！\n总之先跟我来！我们从后门逃走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
